#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.text3"
msgstr "Hatimaye tulitaka kujibu maswali yafuatayo: <strong>ni vitabu gani vipo duniani, ni vingapi tayari tumeshahifadhi, na ni vitabu gani tunapaswa kuzingatia baadaye?</strong> Ni jambo zuri kuona watu wengi wanajali kuhusu maswali haya."

